# ✨ Overview

This is my first portfolio website developed to showcase my profile, skills, projects and contact information using a clean and responsive design.

---

# 🚀 Features

- 🏠 Responsive Home Page
- 👩 About Me
- 💻 Skills Section
- 📂 Projects Section
- 📞 Contact Section
- 📱 Mobile Friendly Design
- 🎨 Modern User Interface
- ⚡ Fast Loading

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| HTML5 | Website Structure |
| CSS3 | Styling |
| Bootstrap 5 | Responsive Layout |
| Google Fonts | Typography |

